    <!-- TOWRdocs Header
         Geostationary View for GOES-16 Test position
    -->
    <!-- TOWRdocs Description
         This scale file implements a geostationary view for the GOES-Test or Center position, origin
         longitude located at 89.5W. This allows a user to select the geostationary view of the Test
         position for GOES.  It is included in the list of other projections in the pull-down at the
         top left hand portion of the D2D perspective to the right of the "Valid time seq" area.
         This file is references in the scalesInfo.xml file.  These files are first pulled down
         from the localization perspective under CAVE - Bundles - Scales.  Copy the scalesInfo.xml
         to the user localization. Edit and add in the pointer to this xml file.
         This file is a modified version of a geostationary projection procedure first created
         manually in cave, and then edited to form a bundle file

         If the site or user already has a scalesInfo.xml modified at that localization, then add the following entry to that file
         for this map to be active:

             <mapScale displayName="Geostationary GOES-Center" fileName="GOES-Test_Full_Disk_scales.xml">
                 </mapScale>
    -->
    <!-- TOWRdocs Status
         New file not found in the baseline, provided by Chris Mello, NHC. 
    -->
    <!-- TOWRdocs POC
         Lee Byerle  4/18/2017
    -->

